   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "**Label drift**: what outcomes say about the model, over the 7 simulated days before each day, with only the outcomes known by then. Alarm when |calibration gap| > **0.158** or Brier > **0.326**. This is the signal that caught COVID two weeks before feature drift did."
   },
